  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Seke Additional Fertiliser Project - Livelihoods Promotion and Protection Zimbabwe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at complimentary the Emergency Food Security programme in eight wards of Seke District in Mashonaland East Province of Zimbabwe. The EFSP will be providing food support to the beneficiaries in the selected wards of the district and this project will ensure that the households that receive food will be able to produce enough food to feed themselves in 2009.</narrative>
  </description>
